00:45:03.150 --> 00:45:05.150
by detecting their subconscious arrogance.

00:45:05.150 --> 00:45:06.650
There was one thing you overlooked.

00:45:06.650 --> 00:45:07.450
What was that?

00:45:07.450 --> 00:45:09.450
Rook applied to you your own tests.

00:45:09.450 --> 00:45:11.370
When you took command of this adventure,

00:45:11.370 --> 00:45:14.070
your heir of authority convinced him that you were one of us.

00:45:14.070 --> 00:45:18.400
And he convinced the others what's happened to them.

00:45:18.400 --> 00:45:22.690
They'll be back tomorrow, on the chessboard, as pawns.

